{"about_the_game":"A drug plantation management game with basebuilding and combat elements.<br><br><strong>You start your venture on a plot of land overgrown by a jungle of trees and shrubs.</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clear the jungle with different tools and turn it into farmland  <br></li><li>Grow different drugs such as cannabis, opium, coca, tobacco and more.<br></li><li>Plan your smuggling routes by finding the most efficient node connections.<br></li><li>Defend against police raids with different weapons to protect your plantation<br></li><li>Process different drugs with techniques such as drying, chemistry, brewing<br></li><li>Use the resources in your area to craft tools, weapons and traps.<br></li><li>Hire workers to farm, process, research or guard the plantation.<br></li><li>Construct huts to house workers, factory buildings and defensive posts.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2861950?t=1750621686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2861950?t=1750621686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861950/cf83d15b4efd28dc5e692a70d914642b22535145/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750621686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861950/cf83d15b4efd28dc5e692a70d914642b22535145/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750621686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"My Drug Cartel depicts shoot-outs between police and criminals in a pixelated art style."},"detailed_description":"A drug plantation management game with basebuilding and combat elements.<br><br><strong>You start your venture on a plot of lan